{"name":"riantr/moonbit_labeler_sample_data","yanked":true,"license":"Apache-2.0","version":"0.1.0","checksum":"53ca8ef571cde87c1d183aca8812b18a51bed34b48723399b0745ee1ac93e8d0","keywords":["test-fixture","dataset","annotation"],"created_at":"2026-10-18T11:59:41.295229+00:00","description":"Sample annotation dataset for MoonBit Labeler test fixtures: six scanned images under Image@skin and one annotation under Label@skin. Pulled by CI so the dataset-dependent tests run without shipping per-deployment data in the repository.","yanked_reason":"Published by mistake and deprecated immediately. This package contains per-deployment security-screening scans (data/Image@skin and data/Label@skin) that this repository deliberately gitignores as user data. Putting them on a public registry was the wrong call: it moved the exposure from not-in-version-control to permanently-fetchable-by-anyone-who-knows-the-coordinate. Do not use this package; app_moui tests need the sample dataset present locally.","preferred_target":"native","supported_targets":"+native"}
